  "description": "~~ENQUIRY BY EMAIL ONLY PLEASE~~\n\nSmart Move Properties are delighted to present Apartment 110, Maritana Gate, a spacious and well-maintained first-floor two-bedroom apartment ideally located in the heart of Waterford City Centre.\n\nThis bright and comfortable apartment comprises an entrance hall, a spacious open-plan living and dining area, a fully fitted kitchen, two bedrooms, including one single room and a master bedroom with ensuite, and a main family bathroom. \n\nMaritana Gate enjoys an excellent location within walking distance of a host of local amenities including supermarkets, retail outlets, cafés, restaurants, pharmacies, schools, and recreational facilities. Residents can also enjoy nearby attractions such as the People's Park, Waterford Greenway, and the vibrant cultural and shopping districts of Waterford City.\n\nThe development benefits from excellent transport connections, with regular bus services nearby and easy access to the N25, linking Waterford to Cork, Wexford, Kilkenny, and surrounding areas. Waterford Bus and Rail Station are also within easy reach, making commuting and travel particularly convenient.\n\nThis superbly located apartment offers the perfect combination of comfort, convenience, and city living in one of Waterford's most sought-after residential developments.\n\nTo register your interest, contact Smart Move Properties today.\n\n~Enquiry by Email Only~",
